pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112711","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112711.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112711.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Since #109458 has been merged, I took the time to make some adjustments in the `Make Unique (Recursive)` popup. One leftover from the same PR was how unique Resources could still be duplicated when  opening the popup.  After Adding that, I realized some improvements on readability could be made, such as adding column titles, and tooltips to explain why a Resource couldn't be duplicated. Also, for custom resouces, Godot Scripts were cluttering the UI, since they by default cannot be made unique in the popup. With that in mind, I'd like to show how it currently looks:\r\n\r\n| Before  | After |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| <img width=\"505\" height=\"441\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/056d2009-9c58-4fcd-ad2e-ac5278b7ddcf\" /> | ![After](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2af91a02-c40c-43ca-a467-bf9d1c4891bb) |\r\n\r\n- Root's property name now shows up in the popup\r\n- Scripts now removed, showing Resources that matters to the user (i.e, which ones they would actually duplicate). Do note that Shaders still show up, like previously.\r\n- Disabling the checkbox if Resource is either unique or has `PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE`\r\n- Tooltip descriptions as to why they couldn't be made unique.\r\n- Column titles to make it prettier\r\n\r\nFinally, this further implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10319, since there's now an indicator when using both the inspector and the popup that a Resource cannot be duplicated.\r\nThanks!\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112711/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112711/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}